{"completed": true, "response": "既然他还不知道自己到底在害怕什么，就不急着决定这份在意以后会怎样。他不必现在就弄清楚两个人将来会是什么关系，也不必因为喜欢对方，就期待对方给自己什么。这样想着，他慢慢能够安心地和那个人亲近了。\n\n他很喜欢这种感觉。心里有一份温柔，可以自然地表达出来，不需要总去确认对方有没有感受到，也不必因为对方对自己很重要，就让自己变得不再从容。有时他甚至觉得，自己比以前更自在了。原来，把一个人放进心里，不一定就会让自己感到不安；他可以真心在乎对方，却不必非要抓住什么不放。\n\n这份快乐确实让他心里安定了下来。他渐渐不再防备自己的喜欢，甚至有些满意，觉得自己能够这样宽容、平和。如果两个人能够一直这样自然地亲近，不用追问什么，也不用计较什么，那该多好。当时的他觉得，这样就已经足够了。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d3ad4e9a-4e1f-4c5f-86c8-b55ad14819c0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002109090371Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.187, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:21:20.302220+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "29fca907e3a3229aa10836e0fae4a3acf0f480cc06cec05c4fce5da18d1f5541", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actua